      "title": "infiniband: remember dissector from dissector_try_heuristic() when reassembling",
      "message": "infiniband: remember dissector from dissector_try_heuristic() when reassembling\n\nThis fixes reassembling for smbdirect, otherwise the\nRPCoRDMA reassembling can take place, even if\npacket_is_rpcordma() decides it is not RPCoRDMA.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>\n",
